Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.34,0:06:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,要讓我念到贏球的稿子喔
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.85,0:06:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,一份炸雞便當
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.85,0:06:15.07,Default,,0,0,0,,謝…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.54,0:06:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,這是什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.69,0:06:16.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs42\\pos(168,663)\c&H1B201D&\3c&HF6FAF5&}厚盛-{\fs54}必勝
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.69,0:06:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 今天是特製的筷子
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.81,0:06:16.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs42\\c&H1B201D&\3c&HF6FAF5&\pos(297,594)}厚盛-{\fs54}必勝
